### Explored Factors

Explored an ATR-normalized, signed 20-day breakout factor:

\[
\text{Factor}=
\frac{\text{close}/\text{rolling-high}_{20}-1}
{\text{median true range}_{20}/\text{close}}
\times \operatorname{sign}(\text{5-day return})
\]

The factor favors instruments near their 20-day highs, scaled by recent trading range, while using the five-day trend sign to distinguish directional breakouts from countertrend weakness.

