### Explored Factors

**Risk-scaled one-day reversal**

Construction:

\[
\text{Factor}_t =
-\frac{\text{close}_t/\text{close}_{t-1}-1}
{\sigma_{10,t}}
\]

where \(\sigma_{10,t}\) is the trailing 10-session standard deviation of daily returns. Higher values indicate stronger expected short-term reversal after adjusting for recent risk.

